    <!-- FAQ Screen -->
    <string name="faq_title">FAQs</string>
    <string name="faq_question_1">What is SplitTrip?</string>
    <string name="faq_answer_1">SplitTrip is a modern expense-sharing and group budgeting application designed to make shared living, everyday expenses, dinners, and group travel stress-free. It calculates balances, tracks spending, and reconciles debts offline or online.</string>
    <string name="faq_question_2">How does the offline-first mode work?</string>
    <string name="faq_answer_2">SplitTrip is built on an offline-first architecture. Any transaction or group edit you make is saved instantly to your local database (Room) and propagates to the UI immediately. When a network connection becomes available, changes are safely synchronised in the background to our Cloud Firestore databases.</string>
    <string name="faq_question_3">Can I use multiple currencies?</string>
    <string name="faq_answer_3">Yes! SplitTrip fully supports multi-currency groups. You can set a default currency for your profile, specify currencies for individual expenses, and see automatically converted balances based on real-time exchange rates.</string>
    <string name="faq_question_4">Is my data secure?</string>
    <string name="faq_answer_4">Absolutely. SplitTrip uses Firebase Authentication to authenticate users securely. Your personal information, group details, and financial transactions are protected using industry-standard transit encryption and robust Firestore security rules.</string>
    <string name="faq_question_5">How do I link my guest account?</string>
    <string name="faq_answer_5">If you started as a guest, you can go to Settings &gt; Account Status and link either a Google Account or an Email &amp; Password. This merges your local guest session with a permanent cloud-backed account so you never lose your data.</string>

    <!-- Privacy Policy Screen -->
    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_1_title">1. Information We Collect</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_1_body">We collect authentication information when you sign up (email, profile name, profile image) and financial sharing details (groups, expense descriptions, amounts, and member lists) to facilitate debt calculations. We do not collect credit card details, bank credentials, or connect to banking APIs. Debt settlements are informational calculations and no money is transferred within the app. Guest accounts store this data only on your device.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_2_title">2. How We Use Data</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_2_body">Your data is processed on-device and synchronised to the cloud for real-time group collaboration. We do not sell or monetise your transaction logs, payment methods, or personal information.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_3_title">3. Data Security</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_3_body">Local data is secured in Room databases and DataStore preferences. Cloud synchronisation is protected by transit encryption and strict Firestore rules, ensuring only members of a group can read or write to it.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_4_title">4. Your Rights &amp; Account Deletion</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_4_body">You retain full rights to your data. You can delete or unlink accounts at any time. Permanent deletion requests can be initiated from the Account Status screen.</string>

